ex items-start justify-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-3"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="launch-tile"><span class="launch-digits text-gold-glow ">--</span></div><span class="mt-2 font-cinzel text-[0.55rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gray-500 sm:text-[0.62rem]">Days</span></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="launch-colon"><i class="block h-1 w-1 rotate-45 bg-gold-400/60 sm:h-1.5 sm:w-1.5"></i><i class="block h-1 w-1 rotate-45 bg-gold-400/60 sm:h-1.5 sm:w-1.5"></i></span><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="launch-tile"><span class="launch-digits text-gold-glow ">--</span></div><span class="mt-2 font-cinzel text-[0.55rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gray-500 sm:text-[0.62rem]">Hours</span></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="launch-colon"><i class="block h-1 w-1 rotate-45 bg-gold-400/60 sm:h-1.5 sm:w-1.5"></i><i class="block h-1 w-1 rotate-45 bg-gold-400/60 sm:h-1.5 sm:w-1.5"></i></span><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="launch-tile"><span class="launch-digits text-gold-glow ">--</span></div><span class="mt-2 font-cinzel text-[0.55rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gray-500 sm:text-[0.62rem]">Minutes</span></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="launch-colon"><i class="block h-1 w-1 rotate-45 bg-gold-400/60 sm:h-1.5 sm:w-1.5"></i><i class="block h-1 w-1 rotate-45 bg-gold-400/60 sm:h-1.5 sm:w-1.5"></i></span><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="launch-tile"><span class="launch-digits text-gold-glow ">--</span></div><span class="mt-2 font-cinzel text-[0.55rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gray-500 sm:text-[0.62rem]">Seconds</span></div></div><p class="sr-only">Early Access<!-- -->: <!-- -->Wed · Sep 30<!-- -->, 2026, <!-- -->13:00 UTC<!-- -->.</p><div class="mt-8 w-full max-w-xl"><div class="relative mx-2 h-px bg-gold-500/20 sm:mx-4"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-500/50 via-gold-300 to-aether-300" style="width:0%"></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-1/2 h-2.5 w-2.5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rotate-45 bg-gold-300 shadow-[0_0_14px_2px_rgba(227,189,110,0.65)] animate-glow-pulse" style="left:0%"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-1/2 h-2.5 w-2.5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rotate-45 border border-gold-500/50 bg-void-900" style="left:100%"></span></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-between gap-4"><div class="text-left"><div class="font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-200">Early Access</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-200">Wed · Sep 30<span class="text-gray-400"> · <!-- -->13:00 UTC</span></div><div class="mt-0.5 text-[0.7rem] text-gray-500">Founder&#x27;s Pack head start</div></div><div class="text-right"><div class="font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-500">Global Launch</div><div class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Mon · Oct 5<span class="text-gray-400"> · <!-- -->13:00 UTC</span></div><div class="mt-0.5 text-[0.7rem] text-gray-500">Free-to-play for everyone</div></div></div></div><p class="mt-6 min-h-[1.25rem] text-xs text-gray-400"> </p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-300/80 transition hover:text-gold-200" href="/guides/aion-2-release-date">Release timeline<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 4 4 4-4 4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-300/80 transition hover:text-gold-200" href="/news/aion-2-founders-packs-on-sale">Founder&#x27;s Packs<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 4 4 4-4 4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="creator-spotlight-heading" class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl min-[1880px]:hidden"><div class="aion-panel relative overflow-hidden p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-abyss-500/15 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><img src="/images/creators/madzillaxsf.webp" alt="Madzilla, Twitch streamer" width="80" height="80" class="shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover h-16 w-16 md:h-20 md:w-20" style="box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #0b0b14, 0 0 0 4px function(){throw Error(&quot;Attempted to call TWITCH_PURPLE() from the server but TWITCH_PURPLE is on the client. It&#x27;s not possible to invoke a client function from the server, it can only be rendered as a Component or passed to props of a Client Component.&quot;)}, 0 0 30px -4px function(){throw Error(&quot;Attempted to call TWITCH_PURPLE() from the server but TWITCH_PURPLE is on the client. It&#x27;s not possible to invoke a client function from the server, it can only be rendered as a Component or passed to props of a Client Component.&quot;)}"/><div class="min-w-0"><span class="aion-eyebrow">Creator Spotlight</span><h2 id="creator-spotlight-heading" class="text-gold-glow font-cinzel text-3xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-4xl">Madzilla</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs mt-1.5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-gold-500/20 bg-void-950/50 px-2.5 py-1 text-gray-300"><svg viewBox="0 0 3 2" class="h-2.5 w-[0.95rem] shrink-0 rounded-[2px]" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="1" height="2" fill="#002B7F"></rect><rect x="1" width="1" height="2" fill="#FCD116"></rect><rect x="2" width="1" height="2" fill="#CE1126"></rect></svg>Streams in Romanian</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1" style="border-color:rgba(145,70,255,0.4);color:#c9a8ff"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="shrink-0 h-3 w-3" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.571 4.714h1.715v5.143H11.57zm4.715 0H18v5.143h-1.714zM6 0 1.714 4.286v15.428h5.143V24l4.286-4.286h3.428L22.286 12V0zm14.571 11.143-3.428 3.428h-3.429l-3 3v-3H6.857V1.714h13.714z"></path></svg>AION 2 Global</span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 sm:items-end"><a href="https://www.twitch.tv/madzillaxsf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Follow madzillaxsf on Twitch (opens in a new tab)" class="btn-ether"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="shrink-0 h-4 w-4" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.571 4.714h1.715v5.143H11.57zm4.715 0H18v5.143h-1.714zM6 0 1.714 4.286v15.428h5.143V24l4.286-4.286h3.428L22.286 12V0zm14.571 11.143-3.428 3.428h-3.429l-3 3v-3H6.857V1.714h13.714z"></path></svg>Follow on Twitch</a><a href="https://www.twitch.tv/madzillaxsf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Follow madzillaxsf on Twitch (opens in a new tab)" class="text-xs text-gray-500 underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-gold-200">twitch.tv/<!-- -->madzillaxsf</a></div></div><p class="relative mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-200">A Romanian content creator who has been streaming part-time for six years, and now she&#x27;s taking her channel into <span class="text-gold-200">AION 2 Global</span>.</p><div class="relative mt-6 grid items-start gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:gap-8"><p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-400">A PC builder and lifelong gamer, she came up through competitive CS2 and Black Desert before setting course for Atreia. Off-stream she works as an IT engineer who, in her own words, plays games way too much. When she needs to switch off, it&#x27;s cars, racing and a quiet road behind the wheel.</p><div><div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-xl border bg-void-950" style="border-color:rgba(145,70,255,0.35);box-shadow:0 0 60px -18px rgba(145,70,255,0.55), 0 24px 50px -30px rgba(0,0,0,0.9)"><a href="https://www.twitch.tv/madzillaxsf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Watch Madzilla&#x27;s stream" class="group absolute inset-0 flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden text-center focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-gold-300"><img src="/images/creators/madzillaxsf.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full scale-125 object-cover opacity-45 blur-2xl saturate-150 transition duration-500 group-hover:opacity-60"/><span class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-void-950 via-void-950/55 to-void-950/20" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-white transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 h-16 w-16" style="background:#9146FF;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(145,70,255,0.22), 0 0 44px -4px #9146FF"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="ml-1 h-7 w-7" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.14v13.72a1 1 0 0 0 1.52.85l10.6-6.86a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.7L9.52 4.29A1 1 0 0 0 8 5.14Z"></path></svg></span><span class="font-cinzel font-semibold tracking-wide text-gold-100 mt-4 text-base">Watch the stream here</span><span class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Opens the Twitch player · in Romanian</span></span></a></div><p class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">Say hi in chat and tell her AION2 Hub sent you.</p></div></div><dl class="grid gap-2.5 relative mt-6 grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-lg border border-gold-500/15 bg-void-950/45 px-3 py-2.5"><dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">streaming</dt><dd class="font-cinzel text-sm font-semibold text-gold-100">6 years</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-lg border border-gold-500/15 bg-void-950/45 px-3 py-2.5"><dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">competitive CS2</dt><dd class="font-cinzel text-sm font-semibold text-gold-100">3.5k+ h</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-lg border border-gold-500/15 bg-void-950/45 px-3 py-2.5"><dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">ex-Black Desert</dt><dd class="font-cinzel text-sm font-semibold text-gold-100">MMO vet</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse rounded-lg border border-gold-500/15 bg-void-950/45 px-3 py-2.5"><dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">off-stream</dt><dd class="font-cinzel text-sm font-semibold text-gold-100">IT engineer</dd></div></dl></div></section><p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-400 md:text-xl">Everything for AION 2 Global, read straight from the game client: the full item and dungeon database, a build planner with real gear stats, season dates and interactive maps of Atreia. Free, fast and always current.</p><div class="hero-enter-up mt-9 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row" style="--enter-delay:300ms"><a class="btn-ether" href="/tools/event-timer">Open the Events Timer</a><a class="btn-ghost-ether" href="/tools">Explore all tools</a></div><div class="mx-auto mt-14 h-[420px] max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-gold-500/15 bg-void-950/40 md:h-[360px]" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></section><section class="relative"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="py-12 md:py-20"><div class="text-center" data-aos="fade-up"><span class="ornate-rule"><span class="ornate-diamond"></span><span class="aion-eyebrow">The Arsenal</span><span class="ornate-diamond"></span></span><h2 class="mt-5 font-cinzel text-3xl font-bold text-gray-100 md:text-4xl">Forged for every Daeva</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-gray-400">Built from the same data that powers the<!-- --> <a class="text-gold-300 transition hover:text-gold-200" href="/tools/dps-meter">AION 2 DPS meter</a> <!-- -->— accurate, fast, and free.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><a class="aion-panel aion-panel-hover group flex flex-col p-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0" href="/tools/build-calculator"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-gold-500/25 bg-gold-500/5 text-gold-300 transition group-hover:text-gold-200"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9L12 3Z"></path><path d="M12 3v18M4 7.5l8 4.5 8-4.5"></path></svg></span><div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="font-cinzel text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-100">Build Planner</h3><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-rose-400/40 bg-rose-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.6rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-300"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-glow-pulse rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>Hot</span><span class="rounded-full border border-gold-500/30 bg-gold-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.6rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-300/90">Beta</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Plan a full character build — gear, Arcana, pets, skills, Daevanion, Pantheon — see your summed stats, then save &amp; share it.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-400/80 transition group-hover:text-gold-300">Enter<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span></span></a><a class="aion-panel aion-panel-hover group flex flex-col p-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" href="/tools/event-timer"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-gold-500/25 bg-gold-500/5 text-gold-300 transition group-hover:text-gold-200"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="8"></circle><path d="M12 9v4l2.5 2.5M9 2h6"></path></svg></span><div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="font-cinzel text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-100">Rift Timer</h3><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-aether-400/30 bg-aether-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.6rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-aether-300"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-glow-pulse rounded-full bg-aether-400"></span>Live</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Live Spacetime Rift countdown, auto-converted to your timezone. Never miss an opening again.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-400/80 transition group-hover:text-gold-300">Enter<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span></span></a><a class="aion-panel aion-panel-hover group flex flex-col p-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" href="/tools/gear-forge"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-gold-500/25 bg-gold-500/5 text-gold-300 transition group-hover:text-gold-200"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 7l6-3-2 6M14 7l-9 9M14 7l3 3-9 9-3-3 9-9ZM3 21h6"></path></svg></span><div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="font-cinzel text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-100">Gear Forge</h3><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-aether-400/30 bg-aether-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.6rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-aether-300"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-glow-pulse rounded-full bg-aether-400"></span>Live</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Simulate enchanting — exactly how many Enhance Stones and how much gold to reach +X, with the pity ramp modelled.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-400/80 transition group-hover:text-gold-300">Enter<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span></span></a><a class="aion-panel aion-panel-hover group flex flex-col p-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" href="/database"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-gold-500/25 bg-gold-500/5 text-gold-300 transition group-hover:text-gold-200"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="8" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M4 6v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6M4 12v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-6"></path></svg></span><div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="font-cinzel text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-100">Database</h3><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-aether-400/30 bg-aether-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.6rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-aether-300"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-glow-pulse rounded-full bg-aether-400"></span>Live</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Every item, skill, set and stat in AION 2 — searchable, filterable, always current.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-400/80 transition group-hover:text-gold-300">Enter<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span></span></a><a class="aion-panel aion-panel-hover group flex flex-col p-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400" href="/maps"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-gold-500/25 bg-gold-500/5 text-gold-300 transition group-hover:text-gold-200"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fil