ll bg-aether-400"></span>Live</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Pick any recipe and get the full base-material shopping list across the whole craft chain.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-400/80 transition group-hover:text-gold-300">Enter<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span></span></a><a class="aion-panel aion-panel-hover group flex flex-col p-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="600" href="/builds"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-gold-500/25 bg-gold-500/5 text-gold-300 transition group-hover:text-gold-200"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M2.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0M16.5 4.6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 6.8M21.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 0-4.5-6.2"></path></svg></span><div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="font-cinzel text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-100">Community Builds</h3><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-aether-400/30 bg-aether-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.6rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-aether-300"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-glow-pulse rounded-full bg-aether-400"></span>Live</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Browse the best shared AION 2 builds for every class — full gear, summed stats, skills and Daevanion — or publish your own.</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-cinzel text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold-400/80 transition group-hover:text-gold-300">Enter<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span></span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="pb-12 md:pb-20"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between" data-aos="fade-up"><div class="max-w-xl"><span class="aion-eyebrow">Schedule</span><h2 class="text-gold-glow mt-2 font-cinzel text-2xl font-bold md:text-3xl">Seasons &amp; Battle Passes</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-400">When the <!-- -->Global<!-- --> season starts and ends, and what runs next to it. Dates are read from the game client (as of <!-- -->2026-09-19<!-- -->).<!-- --> From the Launch Scale Test (playtest) client; may change at launch.<!-- --> <!-- -->Korea/Taiwan<!-- --> season history is on the<!-- --> <a class="text-gold-300 underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:text-gold-200" href="/tools/seasons">full calendar</a>.</p></div><a class="btn-ether shrink-0" href="/tools/seasons">Full calendar →</a></div><div class="mt-6" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100"><div class="aion-panel flex flex-col gap-5 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-stretch sm:justify-between sm:gap-8 sm:p-7" style="border-color:rgba(154,240,230,0.4)"><div class="min-w-0 grow"><div class="font-cinzel text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-aether-300">● Live now · Season 1</div><div class="mt-2 font-cinzel text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-gold-100 sm:text-[2.1rem]">30 Sep → 16 Dec 2026</div><div class="mt-3"><div class="h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10"><div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-aether-400" style="width:4%"></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-4 text-[0.8rem] text-gray-400"><span>Day <!-- -->3<!-- --> of <!-- -->77</span><span>Season rewards can be claimed until <!-- -->28 Feb 2027</span></div></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.04] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-gray-300">Season Mission</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.04] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-gray-300">Nightmare</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.